  "Your hero gains the **^^Daemon^^** keyword and the following regiment options:\r\nAny **^^Blades of Khorne Daemon^^** units\r\nIn addition, your hero has **^^Ward (6+)^^** and change their melee weapon to a **Bloodshed Blade**.": "",
